 "summary": "JWPF is a sealed wire-to-board connector system on a 2.0 mm contact pitch, rated IPX7 under IEC 60529 (grade 7 under JIS C 0920). A through-hole top-entry header with a fitted silicone seal ring mates with a crimp receptacle housing whose silicone seal plate closes around every wire at once; the same receptacle also serves the series' wire-to-wire connectors. Headers come in 2, 3 and 4 circuits in one row and 6 and 8 circuits in two rows; the B06B-JWPF-SK-R is the six-circuit, two-row header, labelled (LF)(SN). Each contact carries 3 A with AWG #22 wire at up to 100 V, from -55 to +85 °C.",
